# `measure` is too large to be copied. Its head asks a field and returns what is kept there: such a head is copied in front of a call, and the rest goes by the call.
# A call of itself is a call like any other: the head stands in front of both, and where the answer is kept no call is made. What stands behind the head is called, so there is one level.
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: frame 1 callee=f1
# CHECK: frame 2 callee=f1
# CHECK: = CallDirect {{*}}function=f1 [isNeverInlined]
# CHECK: = CallDirect {{*}}function=f1 [isNeverInlined]
# RUN(ONCE): walk f1 mechanisms=all
# ONCE-NOT: frame 3
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell
